<title>SWITZERLAND: SNB forecasts 0.1-pct Q1 money supply rise.</title>
<headline>SNB forecasts 0.1-pct Q1 money supply rise.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank (SNB) said it expected seasonally adjusted central bank money supply to rise 0.1 percent in first-quarter 1997 from fourth-quarter 1996.</p>
<p>The central bank also said in an advance summary of its monthly report that money supply rose by a year-on-year 5.0 percent in fourth-quarter 1996.</p>
</text>
